{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 1, "data": [{"docid2": 2233813, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "李盛烨 副市长", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/lsy/202607/t20260702_2233813.htm", "content": "　　李盛烨，男，汉族，1982年10月生，中共党员，研究生学历，法学博士。现任三明市委常委、市政府党组副书记、副市长（挂职），最高人民法院立案庭副庭长、二级高级法官。\n", "docabstract": "<p>　　负责司法、农业农村、林业、法治政府建设等工作，协助负责对口支援工作。</p>  <p>　　分管市司法局、农业农村局（市乡村振兴局）、林业局、供销社、农科院。</p>  <p>　　联系市中级", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/lsy/202607/t20260702_2233813.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.02 17:35:00", "doctitle": "李盛烨", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2446854, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "副市长", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/lsy/202607/t20260702_2233813.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "123213123123123.jpg", "appdocid": 2233813, "appfile": "W020260702636725576988.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/lsy/202607/t20260702_2233813.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202607/W020260702/W020260702636725576988.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/lsy/202607/W020260702636725576988.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/lsy/202607/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/lsy/202607/W020260702636725576988.jpg", "rels": []}], "classes": null}